        "cooked": "<p>Here on Boxing Day we take pity on Space Dad and give him the gift of a straight-up victory.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-271-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-16\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-271-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/4/47438d1e016b270cbb51ad6fd775887d57b8e443.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-271-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #271 - Writers' Room: Cosmic Tales Vol. 2 #16</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Happy Boxing Day, everyone!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:38:31 Today's topic is \"Captain Cosmic and/or Naturalist Story Where Neither Are Responsible For The Relevant Problem And Both Contribute Positively To Its Satisfying Resolution And Neither Are...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/77baba48684230ee0b7569e90b17990fcecc12c6.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/77baba48684230ee0b7569e90b17990fcecc12c6\" title=\"\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/77baba48684230ee0b7569e90b17990fcecc12c6_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"h5aSDcrSUMoUjtxtpltGmH1Yhdc\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/77baba48684230ee0b7569e90b17990fcecc12c6_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/77baba48684230ee0b7569e90b17990fcecc12c6_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/77baba48684230ee0b7569e90b17990fcecc12c6_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/77baba48684230ee0b7569e90b17990fcecc12c6_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">2640×4093 5.17 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
