        "created_at": "2024-01-01T18:14:39.979Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Gotta wonder after this one - would Shattered Veneer and Mr. Hideous team up or be at odds?</p>\n<p>And if Veneer came to Earth and had some plot involving Magmaria, would things go south for him real quick when the Magmarians decided he looks like a tasty snack?</p>\n<p>Also, just for the story name I want a collaboration of Veneer, Halcyon, and the villain with color powers whose name I can’t recall so we can get “Crystal Blue Persuasion”.</p>",
